WEBVTT

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.870
What is this thing?

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:16.270
If you're gonna be an evil boss,
 you gotta stand proud.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:19.670
Your knees are trembling!

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.650
Bisco!

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.410
So you get to die like in 
one of those movies, huh?

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:31.330
Why don't you try saying, 
"I'll be back," Kurokawa?

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.430
Don't let the Rust kill me.

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.170
I want you to put me down and 
take it. Take my life with you.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:46.110
Then one day, when I'm ripped to pieces, 
ground into dust, and reduced to just a soul,

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.240
will I be able to see you again?

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.230
Yeah. We'll meet again.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:01.310
Even after you're gone, I'll always...

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.020
love you.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:41.590
<b>Tetsujin Revived</b>

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:41.590
<b>Tetsujin Revived</b>

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:41.170
<i>Opening circuits to Ganesha Cannon.</i>

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.710
<i>Forcing Rust energy into Ganesha Cannon.</i>

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.200
<i>Rust energy: 120% loaded.</i>

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.090
<i>Releasing safeties.</i>

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:38.270
Oh, no! It's gonna fire!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.550
<i>Firing Ganesha Cannon.</i>

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.950
M-Man, women these days are scary.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.340
Retreat!

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.850
The reactor's out of control!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.510
It's approaching critical!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.970
Evacuate! Imihama's governor is dead!

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.770
Bisco, you did it?

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:20.460
Huh?

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.360
Akaboshi!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.860
Akaboshi! Where are you?!

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:43.650
Where are you?!

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.680
Pawoo!

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.150
Milo!

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.710
Oh, you're safe, boy.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:15.700
And Bisco? Where is he?

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:24.400
So what if my flesh and bones are gone?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.370
My soul will never die.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.850
I'll crawl up out of the 
depths of Hell to protect you.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:32.640
Milo.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.560
We're partners.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.470
We'll be together forever.

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:37.670
So...

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.010
So smile.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:44.740
Whenever you're scared or in pain...
At times like that, you have to smile.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.330
Just like I always did.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:50.930
Whenever you smile, I'll be there, too.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.200
Here.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.120
He's in here.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.370
With me.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:19.440
<b>Imi</b>

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.000
I see.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:33.120
That's the end of Kurokawa's ambitions.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.520
We need more hands! Get over here!

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:50.800
Shit. Who the hell is in
 command of this operation?

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:50.260
Damn it all.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.270
Are you okay?

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:57.970
Little more.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:02.280
Hey, get a stretcher over 
here, too! Hurry it up!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.400
Here good?

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.180
It's no use. The Rust is too 
strong. We can't save them.

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.620
Hurry up! Once all the wounded 
are out, we evacuate!

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:16.730
Is it safe and sound?

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:23.810
I was wondering if Bisco's body 
was still there, safe and sound.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:29.760
<b>Imi</b>

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:32.600
Yeah. Let's go cleanse it of Rust and 
burn it, then take it to his village.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:36.820
No, it's fine. Mushroom 
Keepers don't do cremations.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:41.480
He always said, "If I die, 
leave me to the elements."

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:59.310
I guess... I just wanted 
to see him one more time.

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.670
He'd get mad at me again, though.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.280
What's that?

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.990
That's...

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:35.110
That's Tetsujin!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.230
So it wasn't just a Rust 
cultivation chamber?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.790
<b>Imi</b>

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.340
How is something like 
that still operational?

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.070
That direction leads to...

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.940
No! That's Weeping Child Ravine!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.740
How could it...

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.660
It just burned all the Rust Eater away!

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.160
That thing...

00:10:09.990 --> 00:10:11.630
This way! Come on!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.010
Actagawa!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:55.680
He'll be all right. Steelcrabs don't Rust.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:59.730
Digging him out will be 
a pain in the ass, though.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:06.550
That monster's come back from the dead.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:11.260
Is it going to wipe out Japan again?

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:14.290
Milo!

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:18.970
Don't go, Milo! Did you not see 
the power of that Tetsujin?!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.290
That thing is a god! 
It's destruction incarnate!

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:30.330
I'm the one who got injected with the Rust 
Eater, so I'm the only one who can stop it.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.080
I'll hold it back.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:37.040
Even if that's true, I can't let you go alone!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.470
You know better than that.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.780
I'm not alone anymore.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:50.570
Leave Actagawa to me. 
We'll be right behind you.

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:51.870
Right.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:05.220
He didn't look like he was going off to die.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:15.000
<b>Imihama Watch
Shimobuki Base</b>

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:21.510
Uh, hello?

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:27.080
I brought some bargain goods for you...

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.770
What am I even doing?

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.950
Tirol, I'm sure we'll meet again!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:46.040
We'll talk about you a lot.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:49.440
We'll always be thinking of you, wondering 
where our friend is and what she's up to!

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.460
F-Friend?

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:00.780
I wonder if those guys are still alive.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:10.110
Monster!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.700
My head hurts...

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:20.290
What have we been doing this whole time?

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:23.640
What's up with these guys? 
Coming out of hibernation?

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.700
What's that?

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:30.240
It's a Government Forces helicopter.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.400
What's going on?

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.220
What happened out there?

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.350
Hurry up and refuel!

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:52.360
You guys are Governor 
Kurokawa's elite forces, right?

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:54.560
What the hell happened?

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.440
Kurokawa is dead.

00:13:57.440 --> 00:14:01.140
He and the Man-Eating Redcap, 
Akaboshi, took each other out.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:02.660
<i>Akaboshi's dead?!</i>

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:06.940
More importantly, we're in 
danger. It's coming this way.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:07.840
Huh?

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:12.960
The Government Forces are fighting it, but 
with those toys they use, they'll be wiped out.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.400
We have to get away fast!

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.720
Calm down. What are you so afraid of?

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.820
What's coming this way?

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:31.890
What is that?

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:35.650
That's...

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.750
Tetsujin!

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:53.640
That's Tetsujin?

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:58.420
We won't let some tottering
 relic get the better of us.

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:00.460
All units, prepare to fire!

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.960
Fire!

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.390
How'd you like that, shithead?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:30.650
Wha...

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:36.140
Damn monster!

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:51.340
Akaboshi...

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.520
Where's it planning on going?

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.410
It's heading south.

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.810
We have to do something!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.020
But...

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:09.780
What are you all standing around for?!

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:12.840
Times like these are what the 
Imihama Watch is for, right?!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:15.020
Wh-Who is this woman?

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:17.690
You plan to just leave that thing alone?

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.280
Imihama will become another Tokyo if you do!

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.620
What? Imihama?

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.980
We can't act on our own.

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:27.790
Captain Pawoo gave us strict orders not to 
move from here until she says otherwise.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.730
Are you telling us to just sit 
back and watch that thing?!

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.520
I'm saying you'd just die in vain!

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:37.000
Either way, without Captain Pawoo here 
to lead us, we have no way of fighting it.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.410
For crying out loud...

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.610
What's that?!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.330
A giant monster!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.500
Everybody, run!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:14.210
Akaboshi...

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:18.860
Kurokawa!

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:25.700
You must be pretty pleased that you 
got yourself a slightly bigger body.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:32.480
<b>Zao
Mountains</b>

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.890
Did you think I was dead?

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:33.960
You really thought I'd die 
alongside the likes of you so easily?!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.680
Try saying my name, Kurokawa.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:45.230
If you haven't died enough yet, I'll send 
you back to Hell as many times as it takes!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.190
How awful...

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.860
Is that man all right?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.630
As if that's gonna make me Rust.

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:38.860
The Rust Eater flows through my veins!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:40.760
Oh!

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:49.770
Look at you, crying like a baby.

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:52.890
Do mushrooms hurt you that much?

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.190
Mushrooms are life!

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:01.830
They're the very will to live itself!

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:07.570
So they'll bloom right there to 
stop your outrageous destruction!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.460
We'll fight, too!

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:21.230
Look out! Get away from there!

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.260
Actagawa!

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:30.720
Hey, boy! Shoot!

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:39.330
Keep shooting, boy!

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.370
The hyphae are digging into it!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:44.110
If you can hold out, we win!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.200
Here we go!

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:52.650
Yeah!

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.350
Come on, over here!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.960
When you're up against Mushroom Keepers,

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:10.690
you're 0.2 seconds too slow!

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.310
It's a dead end!

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:41.720
Shit. Even after hitting it with that many?

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.260
It's too strong.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.450
What now? It's acting strange.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.340
It's going to fire!

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:15.600
Jabi-san!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:37.270
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:37.270
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:30.010
You know, it might be a strange thing 
to say, but even if I lose and die,

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:32.050
I think I had fun.

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:33.300
I mean it.

00:23:33.710 --> 00:23:35.700
Next episode: "I'm Bisco!"

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:37.270
I take back what I said.

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:39.350
Go win, Bisco!

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>I'm Bisco!</b>
